      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: Yes that is pretty much what I was thinking. It would help decrease editing times in videos where the audio source matters, and would also be helpful for streamers who want the audience to be viewing from the camera",
