  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-04-15T08:15:46.476Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "i dont actually know how possible this would be, but it would be great to have a way to toggle an audio listener on the camera. This would help for video creators who would like to have their voice recorded like other players are rather than through their own microphone. i can see this being used mainly in creators going for cinema type creations or solo actors without someone to help record. it would give more depth to the audio recorded this way for the camera owner. however, it should be toggleable incase the creator doesn't want their voice recorded this way as well.",
